{"3363430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreamscape Island", "steam_appid": 3363430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363430/extras/028300cc36a2591ef219601018e29f69.avif?t=1772542817\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamscape Island</strong> is a charming, colorful and a cozy game about surviving on a not-so-deserted islands. Join forces with Grumpy and face many enemies, craft some items, catch a fish, search for treasures and help rebuild various buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a brave and helpful kid who woke up on a mysterious island and join forces with her fairy companion, Grumpy. Maybe it's just a dream, or maybe you really were teleported to another world? Who knows? One thing is for sure... Something strange is happening and different worlds are starting to blend! Can you stop it? Or at least fix some damage caused by this multiverse disaster? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363430/extras/2a446ad00e9aa0d95ab4d02a0f884064.webp?t=1772542817\" width=485 height=42 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of funny dialogues (you can skip them if you want) and crazy story about multiverse disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy combat system: your health regenerates automatically and losing won't affect progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and 3D binaural audio nature sounds (try headphones!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse islands: meadows, tropics, caves, mines, modern cities, medieval villages, castles, and even the mysterious Far East... mixed together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, cooking, fixing destroyed buildings and interiors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades: swim further, run faster and increase the capacity of your cute backpack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news: we have univorns. Bad news: they are useless and care only about money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... Hey, what are you waiting for? Start your adventure today, relax and have fun! Dreamscape Islands are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAM DECK STATUS</strong>: supported</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you play change the resolution to: 1920x1080</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363430/extras/028300cc36a2591ef219601018e29f69.avif?t=1772542817\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamscape Island</strong> is a charming, colorful and a cozy game about surviving on a not-so-deserted islands. Join forces with Grumpy and face many enemies, craft some items, catch a fish, search for treasures and help rebuild various buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a brave and helpful kid who woke up on a mysterious island and join forces with her fairy companion, Grumpy. Maybe it's just a dream, or maybe you really were teleported to another world? Who knows? One thing is for sure... Something strange is happening and different worlds are starting to blend! Can you stop it? Or at least fix some damage caused by this multiverse disaster? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363430/extras/2a446ad00e9aa0d95ab4d02a0f884064.webp?t=1772542817\" width=485 height=42 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and relaxing gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of funny dialogues (you can skip them if you want) and crazy story about multiverse disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy combat system: your health regenerates automatically and losing won't affect progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and 3D binaural audio nature sounds (try headphones!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse islands: meadows, tropics, caves, mines, modern cities, medieval villages, castles, and even the mysterious Far East... mixed together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, cooking, fixing destroyed buildings and interiors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades: swim further, run faster and increase the capacity of your cute backpack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news: we have univorns. Bad news: they are useless and care only about money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... Hey, what are you waiting for? Start your adventure today, relax and have fun! Dreamscape Islands are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAM DECK STATUS</strong>: supported</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you play change the resolution to: 1920x1080</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dreamscape Island is a cozy game that combines simple survival elements, exploring mysterious islands, fixing ruined villages, and helping those greedy unicorns. Yes... We have unicorns and they 